WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:01.467
-Oh, good.

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.968
Oh, boy. Oh, boy.

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.601
-Really? Come on.
-This is amazing.

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.868
-Oh, it is amazing.
I'm so happy you're here!

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:08.300
-I'm so happy to be here.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.601
-You came all the way
from Madrid

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:10.701
-Yeah.
-to see us?

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:12.167
-Yeah.
-Thank you so much.

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:13.567
-Why not?
-Yeah.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.100
[ Laughter ]
This is your first ever
talk show,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.834
late night talk show appearance?
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.834
[ Cheering and applause ]
-I'm so honored.

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:22.934
-Can you believe this,
my first talk show here

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.434
with Jimmy Fallon,
Nicole Kidman, too, you know?

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:28.133
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah. It's just us talking.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:29.534
-Yeah.
-Well, I have to talk about it.

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:30.601
Congrats on the success --

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:32.300
"Money Heist."
-Thank you.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.133
[ Cheering and applause ]
It's been crazy.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.567
Thank you, guys.

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:38.701
-When did you realize
that it was just giant?

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:42.567
-Well, I remember I was
in Uruguay.

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:45.734
I was with my parents-in-law
and my boyfriend

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:48.133
and we were celebrating
the New Year's Eve.

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:51.400
-Yeah.
-And it was crazy

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.501
because I went to this party

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:56.300
and it was crowded
and, all of a sudden --

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.634
People didn't recognize me there
before, you know?

00:00:58.634 --> 00:01:00.567
-yeah, sure.
-So, all of a sudden,

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:04.067
everybody was coming
up to me like --

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:06.701
"Tokio, Tokio, eres una diosa.
Eres una --"

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:09.434
[ Laughter ]
And I was like --

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:11.834
-Wow! "Something changed."
-"What's going on here?

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:13.234
This is crazy."

00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:14.734
-"Something changed," yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.601
And I remember I --

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:22.400
Because my brain wasn't able
to understand what was going on,

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.334
I remember I said
to my boyfriend,

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:26.400
"What a coincidence
that all the people

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:30.300
who watch 'Money Heist' are here
in this party," you know?

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.000
[ Laughter and applause ]
-What are the odds?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.167
Everyone who watches the show

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:35.000
are at this party.
-Yeah, it's like,

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.434
"This is crazy."

00:01:36.434 --> 00:01:40.934
I remember I had one million
followers in Instagram.

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:42.400
-Yeah.
-And, the day after,

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.267
I had two million
and I was like,

00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:45.901
"Come on. This is not working.

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.367
[ Laughter ]
Anything is working.

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:49.067
What's going on?"
You know?

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.334
It was crazy. Crazy.
-"How is this possible?"

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:52.501
Doubled from a million
to two million.

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:57.234
Who have you been most surprised
to hear is a fan of yours?

00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:58.467
-Wow.

00:01:58.467 --> 00:01:59.868
I would say Madonna.

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:01.634
-Oh!
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:02.934
-Really?! Talk to me.
-I know.

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:05.667
-Yeah.
"No big deal."

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.767
-You know, celebrities...
-Yeah, me and Madonna, yeah.

00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:09.033
-Celebrities, you know.
-Celebrity, yeah.

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:10.701
-How did you find out
Madonna was a fan?

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:12.000
-So, this is a great story.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.000
I was in L.A. and I was
traveling to --

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.033
I was going back to Madrid

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:20.267
and there was this layover
in London.

00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:23.801
So, when I got on the plane,
I went to the bathroom

00:02:23.801 --> 00:02:26.000
and, when I was going back
to my seat, I saw Madonna.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:26.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:28.934
And it was like --

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.601
"What?!

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:31.801
Is that Madonna?"
-Yeah.

00:02:31.801 --> 00:02:35.334
-And I saw how Madonna
turned back to me

00:02:35.334 --> 00:02:38.801
and she made this eye contact
with me.

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:40.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:44.467
And, all of a sudden, I saw
how she came directly to me.

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:46.601
-She did?
-Keeping the eye contact,

00:02:46.601 --> 00:02:48.000
[ Laughter ]
you know?

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.934
And then, she came to my seat.

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:53.601
Like I don't know how to do it
because I'm wearing this dress,

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:54.667
but...
-Oh, sorry.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:56.968
-...she started
putting on her shoes

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:58.300
like this in my seat.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:01.200
Her sneakers, you know.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.601
-In your seat, on your lap?
-In my seat.

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:04.300
Then she was like, "Hey!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.667
Hi!"

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:09.234
And I was like --
[ Mumbles ]

00:03:09.234 --> 00:03:11.434
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, you go, "Wait.
What's going on?"

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:13.234
-And she said, "I'm sorry.

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:17.667
I just wanted to say
I'm a huge fan of you.

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:19.367
I love 'Money Heist'

00:03:19.367 --> 00:03:22.434
and Tokio is
my favorite character.

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:24.734
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Are you kidding me?

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:26.067
[ Rimshot ]
Madonna says that to you?

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:27.200
-Yeah.
-That's a win.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.834
-Yeah, I know.
-That's a win right there.

00:03:28.834 --> 00:03:33.400
-And I tried so hard
to say something,

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.100
but I couldn't.
No.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.734
[ Laughter ]
Not even a word.

00:03:36.734 --> 00:03:39.300
And I was like --
[ Sputtering ]

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:42.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.601
-Nothing's coming out.

00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:47.334
-And she was like,
"Are you okay?

00:03:47.334 --> 00:03:50.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.968 --> 00:03:53.300
Are you okay?"
-Yeah.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.701
And then she said,
"Do you know who I am?"

00:03:56.701 --> 00:04:00.133
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Oh, my God.

00:04:00.133 --> 00:04:00.934
What?!

00:04:00.934 --> 00:04:02.501
-No, that was embarrassing.

00:04:02.501 --> 00:04:05.901
And I was like,
all of a sudden, I --

00:04:05.901 --> 00:04:08.667
-Came out.
-I could talk, you know?

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:10.467
And I said,
"Of course I know who you are.

00:04:10.467 --> 00:04:12.534
You're [bleep] Madonna."
-Okay, alright.

00:04:12.534 --> 00:04:13.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
Alright.

00:04:13.534 --> 00:04:15.767
Very loudly.
Okay, alright, yes.

00:04:15.767 --> 00:04:17.300
-Know what I mean?
-Yes, I do.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.067
-And then she was like, "Okay."

00:04:19.067 --> 00:04:21.133
She gave me her phone.
-What?

00:04:21.133 --> 00:04:23.367
-And she said,
"Write your phone.

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.167
Give me your phone,"
and she left.

00:04:25.167 --> 00:04:28.901
So, all of a sudden, I was
with Madonna's phone in my hand

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.534
and she left.
-This is Madonna's phone,

00:04:30.534 --> 00:04:32.200
You're entering your contact
in Madonna's phone.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:37.634
-And then I left and I received
this message from Madonna.

00:04:37.634 --> 00:04:39.868
-A text message from Madonna?
-Yeah. And she said,

00:04:39.868 --> 00:04:42.467
"Darling, you forgot
your passport in your seat.

00:04:42.467 --> 00:04:44.067
The stewardess has it."

00:04:44.067 --> 00:04:46.767
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:04:46.767 --> 00:04:50.400
-So I could fly back home
because of Madonna.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.767
Is that unbelievable?
-See? That's exactly

00:04:51.767 --> 00:04:52.968
what she does.

00:04:52.968 --> 00:04:54.834
[ Cheering and applause ]
That's a great story.

00:04:54.834 --> 00:04:57.100
-That's amazing.
-We love you, Madonna.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.667
Of course, she does something
cool like that.

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:00.834
-She's amazing.

00:05:00.834 --> 00:05:02.634
-Get ready. You're going
to love this show.

00:05:02.634 --> 00:05:04.467
-Thank you.
-Here's Ursula Corberó

00:05:04.467 --> 00:05:05.501
in the final season

00:05:05.501 --> 00:05:07.000
of "Money Heist."
Take a look.

00:05:33.701 --> 00:05:34.567
[ Laughs ]

00:05:39.701 --> 00:05:43.200
Yeah! Úrsula Corberó, everybody!
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.801
The final season
of "Money Heist"

00:05:44.801 --> 00:05:46.968
